WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.360
Creativity is measurable.

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:07.042
Creative ads deliver about two and a half times the revenue growth and four times the profit.

00:00:07.092 --> 00:00:11.698
Dull work costs millions extra, and earned media is the real prize.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.200
In the meeting, the safe idea gets nods.

00:00:12.565 --> 00:00:17.491
The bold idea makes everyone squirm.

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:20.022
If it's not bold, it's dumb.

00:00:20.733 --> 00:00:23.737
Yellow Pages' treehouse used zero paid media.

00:00:23.787 --> 00:00:27.452
NRMA's koalas went from thirty-sixth to fifth strongest brand.

00:00:27.502 --> 00:00:29.195
Bold paid off.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.112
Use it like this:

00:00:31.162 --> 00:00:32.739
back bold work with the numbers,

00:00:32.789 --> 00:00:35.882
because the biggest risk is taking no risk.
